OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ARaye hits back at ticket touts who
OL,4,A'overwhelmed' sign-up for Albert Hall
OL,5,Ashow
OL,6,
OL,7,FTo avoid a pre-sale which she felt
OL,8,Fscalpers could exploit, Raye said the
OL,9,Fsign-up list had been manually reviewed
OL,10,Fto identify a shortlist of people
OL,11,Fbelieved to be "real fans".
OL,13,FThe award-winning artist said she had
OL,14,F"never witnessed bots on this scale"
OL,15,Fand was changing the process as it is
OL,16,F"so important" to her that fans can buy
OL,17,Ftickets at the face value price.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
